      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Bowser.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 8, power rating 14 → a level 8 Fighter player-character sheet for <strong>955 BF</strong> (Bowser, King of the Koopas; never above the ledger level — a past self holds no more experience than the present one). The sovereign who kidnapped princesses and conquered kingdoms, eighty-five years before he held the door for Disaster Inc. — the Koopa Troop at full strength, the castle intact, fire in the throat.. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The King Who Held the Door</strong> — Koopa Troop (King) / Disaster Inc. (current situation)</p><p>Status: Active — operating in the Shadow Estate; carrying necromantic evidence; royal war chest active; illegal under hostile mandates and still completely unbothered</p><p>Bowser is the King of the Koopa Troop, a giant fire-breathing turtle-dragon who was cast into the Shadowfell during the Planar Fracture alongside Archie Miser. Since then, he has attended a vampire dinner party where he presumably sat wherever he wanted, tackled a vampire lord through a gothic window, bit a giant bat's wing, and most recently held a door shut against an axe-wielding succession claimant while Markop was unconscious—then punched said claimant in the head and picked up a necromancer's wand asking 'Is this a magic wand?' with the innocent curiosity of a child finding a toy. Waluigi has arm-wrestled Bowser and LOST. Waluigi has also competed against Bowser in every sport imaginable. Bowser is not complicated. Bowser is EFFECTIVE. The current party pass identifies Bowser as Disaster Inc.'s blunt-force sovereign: door-holder, threat magnet, and walking siege engine whose honesty remains more reliable than most alliances.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Claws</strong> — “Bowser is a giant turtle who breathes fire, wants things, and takes them.”</li><li><strong>Bowser's Shell Bash</strong> — “When Orangus Cornelius threatened to turn Bowser's shell into a soup bowl, diplomacy ended because YOU DO NOT THREATEN BOWSER'S SHELL.”</li><li><strong>Fire Breath (Recharge 5–6)</strong> — “Bowser is a giant turtle who breathes fire, wants things, and takes them.”</li><li><strong>Extra Attack</strong> — “Bowser operates on simple logic: see problem, hit problem, problem either stops being a problem or gets hit again.”</li><li><strong>The Shell</strong> — “When Orangus Cornelius threatened to turn Bowser's shell into a soup bowl, diplomacy ended because YOU DO NOT THREATEN BOWSER'S SHELL.”</li><li><strong>Indestructible</strong> — “Bowser is the most INDESTRUCTIBLE.”</li><li><strong>Kidnapper of Princesses</strong> — “Bowser is traditionally an ANTAGONIST—kidnapping princesses, conquering kingdoms, generally being the obstacle that heroes overcome.”</li><li><strong>King of the Koopas</strong> — “- Koopa sovereignty: every alliance with Bowser is also a negotiation with a kingdom.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/bowser</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/bowser/955-bf</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
